PART II — 署名完整性附加条款 / Attribution Integrity Addendum
================================================================================

本附加条款是在 PART I 的 PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 之上追加的
条件与义务。依 PolyForm 的「Acceptance」条款，你必须将本附加条款同样作为
获得任何许可的严格义务与条件一并接受。违反本附加条款即构成对许可的违反，
其补正与终止后果适用 PolyForm 的「Violations」条款。

This Addendum adds conditions and obligations on top of the PolyForm
Noncommercial License 1.0.0 in PART I. Under PolyForm's "Acceptance" clause,
you must accept this Addendum as strict obligations and conditions to all your
licenses. Violating this Addendum is a violation of the license; the "cure and
termination" consequences in PolyForm's "Violations" clause apply.

1. 受保护的署名 / Protected Attribution

   「受保护的署名」指本软件「关于」页（About 页，源代码见
   `src/ui/pages/about.py`）所载明的全部归属与致敬信息，包括但不限于：
   (a) 对原 d3dxSkinManage 作者 numLinka 的致敬，及其社区贡献的陈述，
       以及「本项目与原 d3dxSkinManage 无代码引用、衍生或隶属关系」
       这一事实声明；
   (b) 对本项目创始人及各贡献者（如 Aether、kKevin0001，及日后加入者）
       的署名与角色说明；
   (c) 本许可声明本身及上述「Required Notice」。

   "Protected Attribution" means all attribution and tribute information set
   out on this software's "About" page (source: `src/ui/pages/about.py`),
   including but not limited to: (a) the tribute to numLinka, the original
   author of d3dxSkinManage, the statement of their community contribution,
   and the factual statement that this project has no code reference,
   derivation, or affiliation with the original d3dxSkinManage; (b) the credits
   and roles of this project's founder and contributors (such as Aether,
   kKevin0001, and future contributors); and (c) this license notice itself
   and the Required Notice above.

2. 你不得 / You must not

   (a) 在本软件或其任何衍生作品、再分发副本中删除、隐藏、停用、覆盖，
       或实质性削弱「受保护的署名」的可见性与可达性；
   (b) 篡改、伪造或歪曲「受保护的署名」所陈述的事实——包括冒充作者或
       贡献者、错误标注原创归属、谎称本项目与原 d3dxSkinManage 之间存在
       代码引用 / 衍生 / 隶属关系，或反过来否认对原作者应有的致敬；
   (c) 以使他人对作者 / 贡献者身份产生错误认知为目的，作任何增、删、改。

   (a) remove, hide, disable, obscure, or materially diminish the visibility
       or accessibility of the Protected Attribution in the software or in any
       derivative work or redistributed copy;
   (b) alter, fabricate, or misrepresent the facts stated in the Protected
       Attribution — including impersonating an author or contributor,
       misattributing original authorship, falsely asserting any code
       reference / derivation / affiliation between this project and the
       original d3dxSkinManage, or conversely denying the due tribute to the
       original author;
   (c) make any addition, deletion, or modification for the purpose of
       misleading others as to the identity of an author or contributor.

3. 你可以 / You may

   如实新增真实贡献者的署名，或在保持既有事实准确、致敬与许可声明完整的
   前提下，改进「关于」页的措辞与呈现形式。本条款保护的是署名「事实的真实
   与完整」，而非冻结其文字表达。

   add accurate credits for genuine contributors, and improve the wording and
   presentation of the "About" page, provided the existing facts remain
   accurate and the tribute and license notice remain complete. This Addendum
   protects the truth and integrity of the attribution facts, not the exact
   wording.

4. 存续 / Survival

   上述义务随本软件一并传递；任何再分发副本或衍生作品的接收者同样受其约束。

   These obligations travel with the software; any recipient of a redistributed
   copy or derivative work is equally bound by them.


